Welcome to 02_OS — GNOME desktop on Arch Linux (Pop-style).

  Live login:   user live   password live
  Super+Y       Toggle tiling (off by default)
  Super+Q / Alt+F4   Close window
  Super+T       Terminal
  Super+F       Files
  Right-click dock icons to pin or unpin
  Trash sits on the right of the dock

Install: launch "Install 02_OS" (which runs the provisioner)
